// swarm_drone: a leader whose follower is 6 m behind waits for it. The drone just became leader while it was
// following d1: the active_plan of that follow is still there, but the continue branch checks the role, so the
// follow is not kept.
// method: behave
// expect: succeeded
//   1. !signal_followers
//   2. !hover 1.0

active_plan follow_swarm_leader d1
role leader s1
follower d4
distance_to_leader d4 6.0
roam_point p1
